# Third-party Unreal MCP reference repositories may contain Git LFS pointer-only
# test assets. Keep source/docs tracked, but do not commit missing binary test
# fixtures from cloned references.
# AirSim-family external references: keep source/Docs/configs, exclude local
# clones, build outputs, generated caches, and large compiled artifacts.
#
# Large reference families are staged deliberately. Keep them ignored by
# default, then temporarily unignore one reviewed batch when committing it.
